From 5eb02adeb3b83121b4d836e47b32b0f654411669 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 77450danik <dnsystems@email.ua>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 11:20:52 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] server, win32u, user32: Shell hook messages, as win32k sends
 them.

RegisterShellHookWindow was a stub, so the taskbar never heard about
windows that appear, go away or become active. wineserver keeps the list
for the desktop and posts the messages, the way win32k does.
---
